  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.09 Allowance transfer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.09 “Allowance transfer” means the conveyance of one or more allowances from one account to another by whatever means, including but not limited to purchase, trade, auction, or gift in accordance with the procedures established in this chapter, effected by the submission of an allowance transfer request to the NATS administrator.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
